- sessions.saved [read] Saved sessions on the computer this session runs on (a paired host's own when it runs there): title, folder, last change, path.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"scope":{"type":"string","enum":["local","global"],"description":"local: this folder's sessions; global (default): all."}},"additionalProperties":false}
- sessions.search [read] Search the text of saved sessions.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"scope":{"type":"string","enum":["local","global"],"description":"local: this folder's sessions; global (default): all."}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sessions.rename [change] Rename a saved session.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"sessionPath":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Session file path (.jsonl) from sessions.saved."},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200}},"required":["sessionPath","name"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sessions.delete [sensitive] Delete a saved session file for good.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"sessionPath":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Session file path (.jsonl) from sessions.saved."}},"required":["sessionPath"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sessions.dump_bundle [change] Save a diagnostic bundle as a zip file and return its path: stock's /dump archive of an open session plus OMPdesk's own diagnostics text. Anonymized by default (message contents redacted); pass anonymized:false only when the person asked for the raw transcript. Writes to path, else the Downloads folder. Needs the session open in a tab; defaults to this session.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"session":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Session file path (.jsonl) of an open session, from sessions.saved. Default: this session. A session the person hid from agents is refused."},"anonymized":{"type":"boolean","description":"Default true: stock's /dump anon. false: /dump all, the raw transcript."},"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Absolute path of the zip to write (.zip is added when missing). Default: the Downloads folder."}},"additionalProperties":false}

- sidebar.projects [read] The projects listed in the sidebar of the computer this session runs on (a paired host's own when it runs there): folder path, name, and whether the folder is gone; for this computer also its pin and its own name. Use the paths with the other sidebar.* actions.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.add_project [change] List a folder as a project in the sidebar of the computer this session runs on (the 'Add new project' / open-folder path; a folder removed before comes back). path is absolute. A linked worktree lists its main checkout.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Absolute folder path."}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.remove_project [change] Remove projects from the sidebar of the computer this session runs on, as the project menu's Delete does without its 'also delete saved sessions' box ticked. No folder and no session is touched; opening the folder again in OMPdesk lists it again. path or paths must be listed by sidebar.projects: any other path is reported and left alone.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"One project folder path."},"paths":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":4096},"maxItems":50,"description":"Several project folder paths."}},"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.pin_project [change] Pin or unpin a project in this computer's sidebar (the project menu's Pin / Unpin; pinned projects stay on top). path must be listed by sidebar.projects.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Project folder path, as sidebar.projects lists it."},"pinned":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["path","pinned"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.order_projects [change] Set the order of projects in this computer's sidebar (what dragging a project does): paths top first, each listed by sidebar.projects. Pinned projects stay above the rest; projects not named keep their place after these.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"paths":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":4096},"maxItems":200}},"required":["paths"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.rename_project [change] Give a project its own name in this computer's sidebar (the project menu's Rename; the folder keeps its name). An empty name clears it. path must be listed by sidebar.projects.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Project folder path, as sidebar.projects lists it."},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":0,"maxLength":120}},"required":["path","name"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.pin_session [change] Pin or unpin a saved session in this computer's sidebar (the session menu's Pin / Unpin). sessionPath from sessions.saved.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"sessionPath":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"description":"Session file path (.jsonl) from sessions.saved."},"pinned":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["sessionPath","pinned"],"additionalProperties":false}
- sidebar.archive_sessions [change] Archive or restore saved sessions in this computer's sidebar (the session menu's Archive / Restore: they leave the lists until restored; no file is touched). sessionPaths from sessions.saved.
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"sessionPaths":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":4096},"maxItems":50},"archived":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["sessionPaths","archived"],"additionalProperties":false}

- extensions.install_plugin [sensitive] Install a plugin from a marketplace the person already added (it runs code in every session).
  args: {"type":"object","properties":{"marketplace":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"plugin":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200}},"required":["marketplace","plugin"],"additionalProperties":false}
